{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "M. 86 (PTS 1896[1977]: II 103)"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0131001", "type": "mod", "text": "原本為 Bandhukarogo 讀為 Paṇḍu roga。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[01]，故今於此處加上[01]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0169001", "type": "mod", "text": "依註釋，噴那，是知持祭典用杓之握持方法。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[01]，故今於此處加上[01]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0279001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0279001", "type": "mod", "text": "原本 saññaṁ 為 suññaṁ 之誤排。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[01]，故今於此處加上[01]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0280001", "type": "mod", "text": "gaṇānaṁ gaṇānājivānaṁ Lord Chalmer；Neumann 均解為「算數家之算數生活」，今依字面解釋作如是譯之。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[01]，故今於此處加上[01]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0003001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0003001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為 katham ca 依暹羅本讀為 kañ ca。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007002", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為 ucchepake vate nata，讀為 Uccherake va te ratā（參照 PTS Dictionary, ucchepaka 項）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013003", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為 vimaddhaṁ 依暹羅及 M. I. P. 385 的同文，讀為 vimaṭṭhaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0025001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0025001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為 sacittam sarāgaṁ 參照原本二七頁之文，如 Neumann，讀為 yaṁ cittaṁ sarāgaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0034001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0034001", "type": "orig", "text": "無病（aroga），依照佛音，為常住之義。再生於徧淨天而有光輝。〔注釋〕。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0053001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本讀為 Pavibhattāni Paṭivibhattāni（Neumann）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060001", "type": "orig", "text": "於律藏，經分別之文中，為一日乃至七日不取食之謂（參照南傳大藏經，第一卷，律藏一、二〇頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062002", "type": "orig", "text": "原本有「汝賴吒惒羅！汝為父母既愛且憐之獨子……宜享受愛慾，樂行福德」之文句，在文意上則無為宜，經分別中無此句。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0064003", "type": "orig", "text": "經分別中有「二重造，一為金幣，一為黃金之大蓄積云云」之句。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077004", "type": "orig", "text": "依異本讀為 abyositattā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0124001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0124001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本遺漏，參照下文補充之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0126002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0126002", "type": "orig", "text": "毘訶提（bāhitikā）外衣之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為 Bandhukarogo 讀為 Paṇḍu roga。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0147001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0147001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本遺漏 satta-ussado kho pana so bhavaṁ Gotamo，參照 D. XIV, Mahāpadāna-suttanta & XXX, Lakkhaṇa-suttanta 補足之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0147002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0147002", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為 adduvaṃ 讀為 aḍḍhavaṃ, √rdh。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0147003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0147003", "type": "orig", "text": "原本 adharakāyo va iñjati 讀如暹羅本之 āraddhakāyo va'na iñjati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0150004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0150004", "type": "orig", "text": "依暹羅本補入 addasāma antaragharaṃ pavisanṭaṃ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169001", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋，噴那，是知持祭典用杓之握持方法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0186001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0186001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本無 upasaṁkamati，參照中部第七十經之同文以及下文而改變之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0279001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0279001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本 saññaṁ 為 suññaṁ 之誤排。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280001", "type": "orig", "text": "gaṇānaṁ gaṇānājivānaṁ Lord Chalmer；Neumann 均解為「算數家之算數生活」，今依字面解釋作如是譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0285002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0285002", "type": "orig", "text": "sāmañña 有二義，一為心平等性，二為沙門性。今依前後之關係而取前者之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0287001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0287001", "type": "orig", "text": "平常，比丘在自己住處內只著三衣中的最下衣安陀會（下衣），外出時，則特別在上半身纏上鬱多羅僧（上衣）。因此，此處之衣是指上衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0287002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0287002", "type": "orig", "text": "此處之衣是指僧伽梨。此丘外出時，習慣身纏上下二衣，於腕上則掛僧伽梨衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0292003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0292003", "type": "orig", "text": "原本有 sātthaṁ sabyañjanaṁ kevalaparipuṇṇam parisuddhaṁ brahmacariyaṁ abhivadanti，任何一字都應解釋為和 abhivadanti 有關係，諸異本最初二字 sattha sabyañjana，作為諸法之同格，今如是譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0294004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0294004", "type": "orig", "text": "原本有 gopakehihi，為 gopakehiti 之誤排。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0298001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0298001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本中附以「？」，想是誤排。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0300002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0300002", "type": "orig", "text": "前文有關「受」之述，原本脫漏。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301003", "type": "orig", "text": "原本有 patipucchavīnitā，作如是譯在 Saṁyutta-N 中有 Patipucchā-vinitā（熟練於質問）。後者之例甚多，或者此為正確！"}
{"id": null, "n": "0304001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0304001", "type": "orig", "text": "tuṇhībhūtaṁ tuṇhībhūtaṁ 同語重覆，用力表現，作如是譯。"}
